        "r": 335.61115200000046,
        "b": 733.0429409281768
      },
      "content": "Check each part for leakage or abnormal."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1177",
      "reading_order": 1514,
      "section": "3-7-2. Adjustment",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62,
        "t": 724.8746479999999,
        "r": 540.8698499999999,
        "b": 716.0029289281767
      },
      "content": "Turn the spindle with the speed of 500 rpm and check for its vibration, (about 5 minutes)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1178",
      "reading_order": 1515,
      "section": "3-7-2. Adjustment",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62,
        "t": 707.8947559999999,
        "r": 406.28621999999984,
        "b": 699.0230369281768
      },
      "content": "Slowly raise the rpm of spindle and check for its vibration."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1179",
      "reading_order": 1516,
      "section": "3-7-2. Adjustment",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62,
        "t": 690.914864,
        "r": 331.6522499999997,
        "b": 682.0431449281768
      },
      "content": "If the vibration being high, stop the spindle."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1180",
      "reading_order": 1517,
      "section": "3-7-2. Adjustment",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62,
        "t": 673.8748519999999,
        "r": 253.7297160000001,
        "b": 665.0031329281768
      },
      "content": "Reassemble the cylinder."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1181",
      "reading_order": 1518,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.919826,
        "t": 639.915068,
        "r": 171.388362,
        "b": 631.0433489281769
      },
      "content": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1182",
      "reading_order": 1519,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.379604,
        "t": 605.895164,
        "r": 193.24298399999995,
        "b": 597.0234449281769
      },
      "content": "Seizing power"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1183",
      "reading_order": 1520,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62000000000006,
        "t": 588.9152720000001,
        "r": 541.4981040000011,
        "b": 512.003744928177
      },
      "content": "Seizing power is different depending on the fueled state, used grease, height of soft jaw. When engaging  the  machine  in  chuck  and  operating  within  the  limit  of  maximum  permissible pressure, the actual seizing power decreases as the speed of spindle increases because of a centrifugal power. These relationships between the speed of spindle, power and seizing power are shown in the following graph. Use the following jaw to obtain the seizing power of chuck."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1184",
      "reading_order": 1521,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62000000000006,
        "t": 503.89557200000013,
        "r": 267.32685600000013,
        "b": 495.0238529281769
      },
      "content": "Use the standard soft jaw."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1185",
      "reading_order": 1522,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62000000000006,
        "t": 486.9156800000001,
        "r": 337.2444119999997,
        "b": 478.0439609281769
      },
      "content": "Refill the recommended oil in this manual."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1186",
      "reading_order": 1523,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62000000000006,
        "t": 469.87566800000013,
        "r": 402.9535679999993,
        "b": 461.0039489281769
      },
      "content": "Secure the soft jaw engaging bolt in the specified torque."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1187",
      "reading_order": 1524,
      "section": "3-7-3. Specification",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 127.62017399999999,
        "t": 278.4147680000001,
        "r": 393.43474199999997,
        "b": 269.54304892817686
      },
      "content": "The thrust of cylinder is the permissible maximum one."
    },
    {
